    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Article 112 vs Article 202: Union Budget is presented under Article 112, whereas State Budgets are presented under Article 202.",
        "Primary Deficit Formula: Primary Deficit = Fiscal Deficit - Interest Payments.",
        "101st Constitutional Amendment Act, 2016 paved the way for the implementation of the Goods and Services Tax (GST).",
        "Disinvestment proceeds are categorized as non-debt capital receipts, not revenue receipts."
      ],
